ch05.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Field needs heap indirection] --> Q1{More than one owner?}
  Q1 -->|No, single owner| Box[Box of T]
  Q1 -->|Yes, shared| Q2{Shared across threads?}
  Q2 -->|No, one thread| Rc[Rc of T, not Send or Sync]
  Q2 -->|Yes, cross thread| Arc[Arc of T, atomic count, T must be thread safe]

ch06.chart:
flowchart TD
  Cont["shape can change"] --> Q2{"Need a stable address, not just a position?"}
  Q2 -->|no| I["use an index or typed ID, reborrow later"]
  Q2 -->|yes| Q3{"Few elements or graph-like with churn?"}
  Q3 -->|few| Bx["Vec of Box T: stable pointees"]
  Q3 -->|churn| Ar["arena or slab: access by ID"]

ch07.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Need this value again?] --> Borrow{Can the next step borrow?}
  Borrow -->|yes| UseRef[Pass &T or &mut T]
  Borrow -->|no, needs to own| Move{Single owner moving on?}
  Move -->|yes| DoMove[Move it]
  Move -->|no, need a duplicate| Cont[duplication: continues below]

flowchart TD
  Cont[need a duplicate] --> Dup{Type is Copy?}
  Dup -->|yes| DoCopy[Implicit copy]
  Dup -->|no| Independent{Independent owner needed?}
  Independent -->|yes| DoClone[clone explicitly]
  Independent -->|no, just shared reads| DoShare[Rc or Arc clone]

ch09.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Need indirection or sharing] --> Owners{How many owners}
  Owners -->|one| Box[Box T]
  Owners -->|many| Threads{One thread or many}
  Threads -->|one thread| Rc[Rc T]
  Threads -->|many threads| Arc[Arc T]
  Box --> Move{Must it stop moving}
  Move -->|yes| Pin[Pin Box T]
  Rc --> Cont[shared mutation, continues below]
  Arc --> Cont

ch10.chart:
flowchart TD
  Q1{Is length part of the type invariant?} -->|yes| Arr["Array  T;N"]
  Q1 -->|no| Q2{Need ownership or just a view?}
  Q2 -->|view only| Slice["Slice  and T"]
  Q2 -->|own it| Q3{Will it grow at runtime?}
  Q3 -->|yes| Vec["Vec T"]
  Q3 -->|no, fixed runtime size| Box["Boxed slice  Box T"]
  Vec --> Q4{Tiny and hot, proven by profiling?}
  Q4 -->|yes| Inline["Inline-first small buffer"]
  Q4 -->|no| Keep["Plain Vec T is the default"]

ch14.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Use trait as dyn] --> Q1{Methods take self receiver}
  Q1 -->|no| Fail[Not object safe]
  Q1 -->|yes| Q2{No generic method params}
  Q2 -->|no| Fail
  Q2 -->|yes| Q3{No Self return by value}
  Q3 -->|no| Fail
  Q3 -->|yes| Ok[Object safe: vtable buildable]

ch15.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Modeling need] --> Q2{Sharing data or behavior?}
  Q2 -->|Shared data| Comp[Compose a field]
  Q2 -->|Shared behavior| Trait[Implement a trait]
  Start --> Q3{Hiding representation?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Mod[Module plus private fields]

ch19.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Pick a format for this boundary] --> Q1{Must a human read it?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Q2{Config or data stream?}
  Q2 -->|Config| Toml[TOML or YAML]
  Q2 -->|Data or API| Json[JSON]
  Q1 -->|No| Bin[Binary, see next fork]

ch20.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Repetition spotted] --> Q1{Variation is values,<br/>types, or behavior?}
  Q1 -->|yes| Fn[Function, generic,<br/>trait, or enum]
  Q1 -->|no, it is syntax| Q2{External source<br/>or large surface?}
  Q2 -->|yes| Gen[Build script or<br/>offline generator]
  Q2 -->|no| Q3{Needs item structure<br/>or attributes?}
  Q3 -->|no, local pattern| Decl[macro_rules!]
  Q3 -->|yes| Proc[Procedural macro]

ch22.chart:
flowchart TD
  V[A value of type T] --> Q1{Move to another thread}
  Q1 -->|needs T is Send| Spawn[thread::spawn closure]
  V --> Q2{Share a reference across threads}
  Q2 -->|needs T is Sync| Share[Arc read by many]

ch23.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Two threads need this state] --> Shared{Truly shared, or handoff?}
  Shared -->|handoff| Chan[Channel: move ownership]
  Shared -->|shared| Shape{What shape is the access?}
  Shape -->|one word flag or counter| Atom[Atomic]
  Shape -->|read mostly, rare writes| Rw[RwLock]
  Shape -->|short mixed mutation| Mtx[Mutex]
  Mtx --> Wait{Must a thread wait for a change?}
  Wait -->|yes| Cv[Mutex plus Condvar]
  Wait -->|no| Done[Plain Mutex]

ch29.chart:
flowchart TD
  Cont[Not a number] --> Q2{Crosses often with big payload?}
  Q2 -->|yes| H[Keep resident, pass a handle]
  Q2 -->|no| Q3{Flat bytes or string?}
  Q3 -->|yes| C[Copy slice or string]
  Q3 -->|rich struct| S[Serialize then copy]

ch30.chart:
flowchart TD
  Pub3[publish orders.refunded] --> Ex{direct exchange}
  Ex -->|no binding| Drop[unrouted count]

ch34.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[RSS climbing after release] --> Symptom{Name the symptom}
  Symptom -->|allocs high, live flat| Churn[Clone pressure / churn]
  Symptom -->|live flat, RSS high| Frag[Fragmentation / allocator cache]
  Symptom -->|live heap rising| Retained{Reachable on purpose?}
  Retained --> Cont[expand the retained branch below]

ch36.chart:
flowchart TD
  Submit([submit]) --> Wait[queue wait]
  Wait --> Claim[lease claim]
  Claim --> Run[handler run]
  Run --> Down[downstream call]
  Down --> Done([durable completion])
  Wait -.watched by.-> M1{{queue depth and age}}
  Claim -.watched by.-> M2{{queue latency}}
  Run -.watched by.-> M3{{worker saturation}}
  Done -.watched by.-> M4{{end-to-end SLO}}

ch37.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[Workload] --> Bytes{enough transfer bytes}
  Bytes -->|no| Cpu[Stay on CPU]
  Bytes -->|yes| Intensity{high enough intensity}
  Intensity -->|no| Cpu
  Intensity -->|yes| Launch{launch overhead low}
  Launch -->|no| Cpu
  Launch -->|yes| Gpu[Offload to GPU]

ch41.chart:
flowchart TD
  A[A call can fail] --> B{Is absence just normal?}
  B -->|yes| C[Option]
  B -->|no| D{Can any caller respond?}
  D -->|retry / reject / translate| E[Result with typed error]
  D -->|nothing sensible to do| F{Is a program invariant broken?}
  F -->|yes| G[panic]
  F -->|no| E

ch46.chart:
flowchart TD
  Req[Request bytes] --> V1{Well-formed?}
  V1 -->|no| E422[400 or 422]
  V1 -->|yes| Auth{Authenticated and authorized?}
  Auth -->|no| E401[401 or 403]
  Auth -->|yes| Dom{Domain invariants hold?}
  Dom -->|no| E409[409 or domain error]
  Dom -->|yes| OK[2xx response DTO]

ch47.chart:
flowchart TD
  Start[status + idempotent] --> Cancel{code == Cancelled?}
  Cancel -->|yes| NoRetryC[retry = false: caller_cancelled]
  Cancel -->|no| Transient{Unavailable or DeadlineExceeded AND idempotent?}
  Transient -->|yes| Retry[retry = true: transient]
  Transient -->|no| NoRetry[retry = false: do_not_retry]

ch50.chart:
flowchart TD
  In[Inbound message] --> Sz{size within cap?}
  Sz -->|no| Drop[Reject, score peer]
  Sz -->|yes| Tp{topic / version known?}
  Tp -->|no| Drop
  Tp -->|yes| Rt{rate limit ok?}
  Rt -->|no| Drop
  Rt -->|yes| Heavy[Allocate + decode payload]
  Heavy --> Handle[Process request]

flowchart TD
  Start[compare local vs remote] --> V{remote.version > local.version?}
  V -->|yes| TakeR[keep remote]
  V -->|no| V2{remote.version < local.version?}
  V2 -->|yes| TakeL[keep local]
  V2 -->|no, tie| A{remote.author > local.author?}
  A -->|yes| TakeR
  A -->|no| TakeL

